    "methodology_summary": "The paper proposes a dynamic cryptocurrency portfolio strategy combining technical indicators (14-day RSI and SMA) and news-based VADER sentiment scores. A Ridge regression model is estimated within each rolling window to predict next-day returns using these technical and sentiment signals, adjusting expected return estimates for a constrained mean-variance optimization framework. The portfolio is rebalanced daily using a sliding window approach with a 180-day training window and incorporates weight caps, turnover limits, and transaction costs.",
